WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.219
Hi! Let me show you my family's things. Whose is it? Let's see!

2
00:00:07.669 --> 00:00:10.874
Look at this red car! Whose car is it?

3
00:00:11.324 --> 00:00:14.342
It's my brother's car. He loves it!

4
00:00:16.592 --> 00:00:19.239
This is my parents' house, near the sea.

5
00:00:19.689 --> 00:00:24.519
Parents ends in S, so we write only the apostrophe.

6
00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:30.949
And this is my sister's dog. His name is Toby.

7
00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.542
This little puppy is my children's puppy.

8
00:00:36.992 --> 00:00:42.147
Children doesn't end in S, so we say: children's.

9
00:00:44.397 --> 00:00:48.066
And this is my grandma's farm. I love it!

10
00:00:48.516 --> 00:00:50.931
And you? What's your mother's name?

